Subject: [PATCH v22 12/19] drm/xe/vsec: Support Crescent Island PMT
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 16:39:08 -0800
Message-ID: <20261124003856.4145635-33-michael.j.ruhl@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.43.0
In-Reply-To: <20261124003856.4145635-21-michael.j.ruhl@intel.com>
References: <20261124003856.4145635-21-michael.j.ruhl@intel.com>
X-Mailing-List: platform-driver-x86@vger.kernel.org
List-Id: <platform-driver-x86.vger.kernel.org>
List-Post: <mailto:platform-driver-x86@vger.kernel.org>
List-Help: <mailto:platform-driver-x86+help@vger.kernel.org>
List-Subscribe: <mailto:platform-driver-x86+subscribe@vger.kernel.org>
